      "description": "1 Euro is a minimalist paid app. It shows a single bold line of text. Tap to see another line. That is the entire experience.\n\nThis is a tiny monument to unnecessary purchases. It is honest, simple, and intentionally empty.\n\nWHAT YOU GET\n• One bold sentence at a time\n• Tap to get a new line\n• Clean, all-white aesthetic\n• No accounts, no ads, no tracking\n\nWHY PEOPLE BUY IT\nSome apps promise everything. This one promises nothing — and delivers. It is a conversation starter. A statement. A tiny rebellion against apps that demand your attention, your data, and your time.\n\nTHE EXPERIENCE\nOpen the app. Read the line. Tap for another. Close it. Come back tomorrow for something new. Or don't. There are no notifications. No achievements. No pressure. Just words.\n\nPERFECT FOR\n• Anyone who has bought something they didn't need\n• People who appreciate minimalism\n• Those who enjoy absurd humor\n• Collectors of unique apps\n\nPRIVACY FIRST\nNo data collection. No analytics. No internet connection required. Your 1 Euro experience is entirely yours.",
